        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172720/extras/7a01836e23a953dcf7faee14f23c4288.avif?t=1772270497\" width=1560 height=476 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「ISLET GARDEN」 is an idle game you can enjoy right on your desktop. Plant vegetation on your island, and its residents will automatically gather resources for you. Use the resources you collect to upgrade systems and steadily decorate and develop your island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your primary action is simply planting seeds—watering plants and collecting resources are handled by the islanders</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172720/extras/3f2c0ba56b12331346ae6ec02dcffb75.poster.avif?t=1772270497\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172720/extras/3f2c0ba56b12331346ae6ec02dcffb75.webm?t=1772270497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172720/extras/3f2c0ba56b12331346ae6ec02dcffb75.mp4?t=1772270497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The plants that grow from your seeds are random. Each plant yields different types and amounts of resources, so replant strategically to obtain what you need!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172720/extras/76a819787267809183ed45069bb960ad.avif?t=1772270497\" width=1560 height=476 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your island fills with greenery, the workload for its residents will increase. Enhance your plants and collection processes to improve efficiency and keep your island thriving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172720/extras/7a01836e23a953dcf7faee14f23c4288.avif?t=1772270497\" width=1560 height=476 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「ISLET GARDEN」 is an idle game you can enjoy right on your desktop. Plant vegetation on your island, and its residents will automatically gather resources for you. Use the resources you collect to upgrade systems and steadily decorate and develop your island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your primary action is simply planting seeds—watering plants and collecting resources are handled by the islanders</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172720/extras/3f2c0ba56b12331346ae6ec02dcffb75.poster.avif?t=1772270497\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172720/extras/3f2c0ba56b12331346ae6ec02dcffb75.webm?t=1772270497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172720/extras/3f2c0ba56b12331346ae6ec02dcffb75.mp4?t=1772270497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The plants that grow from your seeds are random. Each plant yields different types and amounts of resources, so replant strategically to obtain what you need!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4172720/extras/76a819787267809183ed45069bb960ad.avif?t=1772270497\" width=1560 height=476 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your island fills with greenery, the workload for its residents will increase. Enhance your plants and collection processes to improve efficiency and keep your island thriving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
